# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libice
pkgver=1.1.2
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="X11 inter-client exchange library"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(xtrans glibc)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/libICE-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('974e4ed414225eb3c716985df9709f4da8d22a67a2890066bc6dfc89ad298625')

build() {
    cd libICE-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static \
        --disable-docs --disable-specs
    make
}

package() {
    cd libICE-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
